  "abstract": "Bolthausen used a variation of Stein\u2019s method to give an inductive proof of the Berry-Esseen theorem for sums of inde pendent, iden- tically distributed random variables. We modify this techn ique to prove a Berry-Esseen theorem for character ratios of a random repre sentation of the symmetric group on transpositions. An analogous result is p roved for Jack measure on partitions.",
